{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060260/block/singleImage/3248260/df/01M5V0407QQTGF9CAM9FQYS1FP.png?updatedAt=1792989926\"/><figcaption>港島半山羅便臣道（Google Map/資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>港島半山羅便臣道發生盜竊案。周日（25日）下午5時57分，警方接獲一名56歲姓李女子報案，指其位於羅便臣道的單位內，一批約值60萬元的首飾不翼而飛，懷疑遭人盜去。 警方接報到場，經初步調查後，將案件列作盜竊，交由中區警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。消息指，首飾包括頸鏈、手鏈及戒指等，涉案疑人為一名37歲持香港身份證的菲律賓女子，她曾在上址擔任傭人，在10月中離職。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:47.291897+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:20:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:11.111920+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:06.503992+00:00","content_hash":"afb0b6e88808d72a30f7d6454d5b98eea1422883f0c668f9b5df85864e5de8df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:47.291897+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}